{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mystical realm of Luminaya, where you are the witchy Marie, caught in a mysterious forest teeming with terryfing ghostly shadows. But have no fear! You have the power to dispel these shadows and illuminate the way to your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/1c014dfa3ecb740452546e774c955cc8.avif?t=1761332032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras_big/1c014dfa3ecb740452546e774c955cc8.avif?t=1761332032 width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out to explore this mysterious forest, on a journey to find runes and hidden glades. Activate rune stones and illuminate the darkness to vanquish terrifying shadow creatures! Uncover the hidden secrets and the mysterious stories of the creatures and your own past. On this night, every moment could be your last, and the unknown is waiting for you to discover it. So, are you ready to face the challenges and find your way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/e42a1ed6e64160df865024e2c36e48f5.avif?t=1761332032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras_big/e42a1ed6e64160df865024e2c36e48f5.avif?t=1761332032 width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your magic wand, you can create orbs of light with unique effects by drawing different runes. Use your creativity to outsmart the shadows and light up the glades. Each rune is infused with its own unique power, whether it's deflecting shadows, casting light, or offering a brief shield of protection. Master the art of rune magic and find the best way to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.poster.avif?t=1761332032\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.webm?t=1761332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.mp4?t=1761332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/5f698e30f502da15af4605f7460e19ff.avif?t=1761332032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras_big/5f698e30f502da15af4605f7460e19ff.avif?t=1761332032 width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and watch your back against those shadow creatures. Think strategically and hide cleverly to escape their gaze. Use the runes and the surroundings to your advantage to remain undetected. Any mistake could mean your end, so be vigilant and plan every step carefully, and you will succeed. Trust your instincts, and you will find the a way to exile the shadows and escape the forest!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525380?t=1761332032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/30ecec02e7d7e82d9a64324fea683d009e7c44c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761332032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/bdff2d34b8c929e210707fd5aa173d5ff0d27682/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761332032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/bdf