 outsmart the shadows and light up the glades. Each rune is infused with its own unique power, whether it's deflecting shadows, casting light, or offering a brief shield of protection. Master the art of rune magic and find the best way to achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.poster.avif?t=1761332032\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.webm?t=1761332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/163346c64f8b251623e87dde79a1e602.mp4?t=1761332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras/5f698e30f502da15af4605f7460e19ff.avif?t=1761332032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525380/extras_big/5f698e30f502da15af4605f7460e19ff.avif?t=1761332032 width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and watch your back against those shadow creatures. Think strategically and hide cleverly to escape their gaze. Use the runes and the surroundings to your advantage to remain undetected. Any mistake could mean your end, so be vigilant and plan every step carefully, and you will succeed. Trust your instincts, and you will find the a way to exile the shadows and escape the forest!</p>","developers":["Mystery-Project Technology UG (haftungsbeschr\u00e4nkt)"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst